the Lightamer project (M9-2). Chart sample points, transmittance
percentages, characteristic-curve readings and RMS granularity values are
measurements — facts, which are not copyrightable. The underlying
manufacturer documents remain the property of their publishers; the PDFs
are NOT redistributed in this repository (hashes below only attest what
was digitized). No array or table was copied from any third-party dataset
(nothing from SpektraLab / spektrafilm resources was used as a data
source; that corpus was at most read for FORMAT conventions, which are
not protectable).

