DIGITIZATION
------------
Tooling: Scripts/bwprofile/ (uv + pdfplumber + Pillow + numpy).
Vector PDFs: axis tick-label affine fit (sub-pixel residuals logged) +
polyline resampling at full coordinate precision. Raster charts: 300 dpi
pdfium page renders, gridline/tick pixel anchors, ink-threshold run
segmentation with sub-pixel weighted centroids and claim-based
slope-aware curve walkers. Every modeled quantity carries an ASSUMED tag
in the profile's metadata.tags; quantities read off the sheet carry
SHEET tags. Rebuild: uv run python3 extract_kodak.py / extract_wratten.py
/ build_wratten.py / trace_all.py / assemble_profiles.py (PDFs present in
the evidence store).
